    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not just about being tired though. i see the look in my husband's eyes when he has to help me with things i used to do myself. it's like he's grieving me even while i'm still here. part of me thinks if i wasn't around, he could actually start his life again instead of just managing my decline.",
